Source common.tape
Output data_flow.mp4
Env SCENE_FILE "sorting/Sorting.lean:3"
Source open.tape

Type "15gg" Type "gs" Sleep 300ms Type " h" Sleep 2500ms Type ",;"
Type "54gg" Type "gs" Sleep 300ms Type " h" Sleep 2500ms Type ",;"
Type "8gg" Type "gs" Sleep 300ms Type " h" Sleep 2500ms Type ",;"
Ctrl+B Right Sleep 500ms
Type@400ms "jjl"
Sleep 3s
